<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 16:03:42 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Keuliakegai</para>
  <para style="toc1">John de Keuliakegai laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Keuliakegai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Keu.</para>
  <para style="mt">Revelation</para>
  <para style="mt">John de Keuliakegai laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Langkegaibe John Patmos duigwadeu ga mibaang tei keladau (AD 95-96) Keuliakegai laisiu de raugai. John laisiukwak aide rau kegai kie becai, Khristianmedung Jisu Khrista de kenlum ziemne mine ngaurau eh kehereisüt kebam dau keregui nah teikengkuu peugai kerane raugai. Khristianme kideu aika ma kehei tei liede Tinggwang ne kezeu pwa kebam ci maisia.</para>
  <para style="ip">Marengei nah marehi gade, penui madauge ci lupa di liede, mage au mcigi, Jisu Khrista au Rampaube nah mina leune nah maleune reu di kelabe-mina sorkari kengkiengbedung liede. Pa au kenzeusiak eh la nah tingnai ge kemau, Satan kecangde mmau nah saja dizie. Pa tinggim keheci ge nah kideu keheci ge si eh kelungta bam kera hegwangram ge tei luzie.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista ne John de peu ngau kegai (1:1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngqwa hena dage laisiudung kekai (2:1-3:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggim hegwangbam (4:1-5:14)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaugiak hena (6:1-8:5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Telui hena (8:6-11:19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Makau hena (12:1-14:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Lunghop kwakdung (15:1-16:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Babylon de kemmau (17:1-19:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Makau nah kenret caihakecime de kemmau (19:11-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Satan de kemmau (20:1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mmi cang ge hegwangketei (20:4-6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kehebwak nah kemmau kekambe (20:7-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggim keheci, kideu keheci, Jerusalem keheci (21:1-22:5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sam kekambe (22:6-21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Sam keraibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Aide Jisu Khrista dade kegwang keuliakegai, tei nzet gwang keradung pe kilame dage keulia kerane Tinggwang ne pecu kepeu de. Pa pe tinggimgwabe dage pe kilabe John dage langgai eh peu cigai. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />John pa kengaube pelane, Tinggwang sam nah Jisu Khrista<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:6">Keu. 22:6</ref></char></note> ha, zierang teigai. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Caihakeci samdung aide pei kelame nah kingnei kelame nah raupwa keladung mzai kelame samlam pungtu lie, kedanemene ma aidungde tei gwang kera peting nna bamdi delu.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai nah ketwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />John ne Asia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cudau Turkey lie qu kelade.</char></note> ga kebam ngqwadung hena dage kekai: Cude kelabe, ndaa de kelabe, nah gwangdai kerabe dade, nah rabedung hena pe hegwangbam dwaga kebam dade, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />nah Jisu Khrista, kesamsang zierang keteibe, ketsai gade ringdai kelu raitube, nah kideube ga hegwangmedung reu kengkiengbe dade nnui da ngaugia nah lungciep bam kelube tei lulo. Anuide hung kelabe nah pe jai le anui mau gade anuide keli kebeube, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:8">Col. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />pa anuide hegwangram ge nah Tinggwang nah Peibe ziemne cingkume ge teibeu da—peu pecu kelungta ndu nah ngkieng kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Ainie, Khrista hemwa gade gwangzeu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">mina leune pecu ngau zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">pecu reu kegaime de si eh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Kideu ga heleuh pelane pe ziemne hap dizie.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 1:7">Peu ciciu kelube tei lulo, Amen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zec. 12:10</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat. 24:30</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 26:64">26:64</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mrk. 13:26</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 14:62">14:62</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Rampaube Tinggwang ranggai “Ih au alpha nah omega,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Greekme laisiu kau gade keraibe nah kebambe, nah cide raitube nah kamtube de rangbam.</char></note> cu kelabe, nah ndaa de kelabe, nah gwangdai kerabe, Ngkiengtube.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mina Nabe kenzwa ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ih John, nnui sinabe, Jisu gade keherei kecu ga nah hegwangram nah sünne eh lia kecu gade nnuide ngngwa kencütbe, Jisu ha zierang nah Tinggwang sam ziemne duigwadeu Patmos lie qukela de ga la. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Rampaube tingba benai Tinggwang Rabe acu kezeu teudi, nah a caile biede telui kwa kenzwa ge sahbak kegai Ih siu. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Cide ranggai, “Nang kengaubedung laisiukwak gage raulu, delwe ngqwa henadung dage cide langgai lulo—Ephesus namdi, Smyrna namdi, Pergamum namdi, Thyatira namdi, Sardis namdi, Philadelphia namdi, nah Laodicea namdi dage.” <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ih a dage marang kebam kwa de pie zielie nreugwang, nah Ih nreugwang ge Ih kecak mitaubungbam hena ngau. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Mitaubungbam sum ga Mina Nabe kenzwa ge, cwatie ge pepi ga hung cang cuge ncwabam, nah kecak kiakangria ge pe hekarak kang pung bam. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Pe peu nah petam au mamai nzwa ha—buising nzwa hareidi—nah pemiak au miheu nzwa. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Pe pi au hetageu neundui pwa kebambe nzwa, hetageu mi gage ru mci kelube nzwa, nah pe kwa au dui kekiee lwa kemie kwa nzwa. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Pa pe ba zetle hegi hena pwa bam, nah pe mui gade kingtie pemui keyi lule ailam kebam ge pet bam. Pe zu au naimiak tingna tingding dau kebaa nzwa baa. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ih pecu kengau dau, Ih ketsaime nzwa pe pi ga keumie di. Pa pe ba zetle areu gage kai eh ranggai, “Ngngi so, Ih au Raitube nah Kamtube, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />nah ringla kelabe. Ih tsai di, dede ainie, Ih ringlamui dida! Ih Ketsai nah Hades cabi teula. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Ciziemne nang kengaubedung rau lulo, cu tei kebambe, nah aipaucai tei gwang kerabedung. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Nang a ba zetle hegi hena kengau de nah kecak le ketei mitaubungbam hena kebam kengkim kie de ainzwa: Hegi hena de cai ngqwa henadung tinggimgwame, nah mitaubamdung henadung de cai ngqwa henadung deda.”<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ephesus ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Ephesus namdi ga kebam ngqwa samgwabe dage rau gailu: ‘Pe ba zetle hegi hena pwa kebambe nah kecak mitaubungbam hena kakga tet kebambe, aide rangzeu: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />“Ih n batadung nah nang laikai tei eh heta tei kebam nah nang sünne eh lia kebam, nah mina kesia keteime de nang lia lula kemak cibam. Nang mi penuikatei penuide le langkegaime meliede, ciciu lie kelamedung de kedak pieda, nah nang penui kenretme kecu cilu da. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Nang n lung tie nah nang a zi ziemne keherei sütgai, ciciude nang leudi kemak Ih cibam. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Dede nang acu keku de gi kedi ziemne Ih ncu mmau la. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Cine nang dai gade kaudi bi kecu nsung lulo. Nlung nreulu delwe ndaa ketei tadung de teilu. Dede ciciu lu mecai, Ih nda gwang eh n mitaubungbam de pe bam gade keugi dizie—nang nlung nreulu mecai. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Dede nang au aide bam: Nang au Nicolaitanme batadung de ngkaula, Ih de cide ngkaula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:21">Lei. 139:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang Rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo. Ngkieng kelube de peu Tinggwang kereluini ga kebam kering tsingbang tsi de gade tyei kera Ih tei beuzie.”’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:11">Keu. 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smyrna ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Smyrna namdi ga kebam ngqwa samgwabe dage rau gailu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">‘Raitube nah Kamtube, tsai di eh ringdai kelube aide rangzeu:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:17-18">Keu. 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />“Ih n reidung nah nang magah kebam cibam (dede nang au mahei), nah penuikatei penuide le pwane Jewme lie la, dede kemakme, meliene penui au satan ngqwame nnuide rangmsia kelade Ih ci bam. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Nang a ziemne keherei lai eh kebam de hing so. Ainie! Herakesiabe nnui kangge de kedak pie kerane hebaangki gage kelien gai laizeu, nah nnui ziangrei ge keherei zie. Ketsai kecangde masanglu, iciu de Ih ncu kering peurwa peuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:12">Jas. 1:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang Rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo. Ngkieng kelube de ketsai kenabe ne tei rezam dilak.”’”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pergamum ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Pergamum namdi ga kebam ngqwa samgwabe dage rau gailu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">‘Kiengtie pe mui lule ailam keteibe kebambe aide rangzeu: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />“Ih nang lungh kebam ni de cibam, cide Satan hegwangbam kebam ga. Dede nang a zi de herak ntiprip pwabam nah Antipas a zierangbe, a kesamsangbe, Satan lungh kebam ga, nnui kakgade teitset kedi tingdau kecang de nang n kenlum ada kebam de mlaidi ma. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Dede madungge gade Ih ncu mmau bam: Nnui kakga mina kangge Balaam keledeu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Balaam keledeu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">penui Balaam keledeu de nzwa ledeu, cine pecu ngngwa pe maa ga ket lie lubui.</char></note> de herak ntiprip eh kebamdung ge bam, pa Israelme namedung dwa gage mipi kensui ge kelien gai kera Balak de ledeu beu, iciu eh peu penuide mamie de reca beu kedi ketyeipuk tyei nah kemmha ta teilu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:4">Hez. 23:4</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Cinzwa eh nnui kakga mina kangge Nicolaitanme keledeu de herak ntiprip pwa kebamdung ge bam. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Cine, helungnreu lulo! Dede nang ciciu lu mecai, Ih nda zette gwang zie, delwe a mui gade kepet kingtie de le penuide renia zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:5">Keu. 2:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang Rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo. Ngkieng kelube de, Ih manna hebai pwa kelade kesa peuzie, nah tangtsu keha reu gage hezi keheci ge raulwe Ih pecu peu zie, hezi cide ngau kelube ne gwale migede ci gailak.”’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Keu. 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thyatira ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Thyatira namdi ga ngqwabe samgwabe dage rau gailu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">‘Tinggwang Nabe, pe miak miheu nzwa kebambe nah pe pi hetageu neu nzai pwa kebam nzwa kebambe ne aide rangzeu:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan. 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />“Ih n batadung, n keku, n masang, n ta nah nlung ketie de cibam. N bata keraibedung de swade cudau batadung be yiki. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Dede Ih aide ncu mmaula: Nang mipui Jezebel,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:29-31">1 Heg. 16:29-31</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:22">2 Heg. 9:22</ref></char></note> pekatei pecu le pwane caihakecibepui lie kelabe puide mzai la. Pe keledeu dene pa a kilamedung de cwa eh peu kemmha ta tei nah peu mamie de ratak teibeu kedi taktyei de tyei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:14">Keu. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ih pecu helungnreulu kera ting pwa peu, dede pa pe mmha gade nreu neu tadi. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ainie! Ih pecu keteeizeu gage kai dizie, nah pecu ngngwa eh kemmha ta keteime de peu kehereisüt zie, petadung gade penui helungnreulu meliecai. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Ih pe name de teitset dizie, nah ngqwadung pelane Ih milungning nah lungcetdung pie kelabe lie kecu ci luzie. Ih nnui hangge gede nnui batadung rehi gade peu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Lei. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Dede nnui Thyatira ga kebam kedame, keledeu aide mzai la kemakmedung, nah Satan gu kengkim kecok lie eh kangge rang keladung de ci kemakme, Ih nnui dage rangla, ‘Ih nnui dage hepüt kerüt kedage de kaisi ma.’ <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Dede Ih gwang kemaktane nnui herak pwa kebam de herakntip pwa bamlu.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Ngkieng kelube nah penli kecang a tadung tei jüja bam kelube de, Ih heleuhdung reu kengkieng teu kera pecu peu zie.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />‘Pa hegeutie ge teu penui reu di zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 2:27">tangdei lidung nzwa eh, pa penuide tei pang kecai dizie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8-9">Lei. 2:8-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Ih a Pei dade ngau kelu nzwa, Ih de pecu hegi tingcangpui de pecu peu zie. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang Rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo.”’”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Sardis ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Sardis namdi ga kebam ngqwa samgwabe dage rau gailu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">‘Tinggwang Rabe hena nah hegi henadung pwa kebambe aide rangzeu: “Ih n tadung cibam. Nang au ring bam lie kecu hezibe mzi pung bam, dede nang au tsai dida. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Mraklu delwe tsaidi lai eh kebam na de tei ngkieng lulo, kedanemene Ih n batadung a Tinggwang miakngau gade yicang kebam ngaulu melu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Cine nang ngau nah siu kelude nsung lulo. Cide mzailu, delwe helungnreu lulo. Dede nang mraklu mecai, Ih keregame ge nzwa gwang zie, nah Ih nda daipau bamdakkak ga gwang ziebi kecu nang au cilak. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Dede Sardis namdi ga mina kiee kemaknage penui paini teihera kemakme bam, nah penui keha teulwe acu ngngwa tetzie, kedanemene penui au ciciulu kebuime lu. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Penui nzwa ngkieng kelube penui paini keha bah zie, nah Ih madaude Kering Laisiukwak gade pe zi mai ngga dilak, nah Ih pe zi Apei dwa gade, nah pe tinggimgwame dwa gade ndu gaizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:27">Keu. 21:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo.”’”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philadelphia ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Philadelphia namdi ga kebam ngqwa samgwabe dage rau gailu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 3:7">‘Kemcibe, kesangbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">David gu cabi kebambe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">pa ngkei kegaibe migede ngkui gai kelakbe,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 3:7">nah pa ngkui kedibe migede ngkei gai kelakbe, pa aide rangzeu:<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“Ih n batadung ci. Ainie, Ih n dwa gage kikam ge ngkei nzeu, cide migede ngkui gailak. Kedanemene nang n kengkieng kecam nage bam, ciciu de nang a sam mzai nah a zi de mlai dima. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Ainie! Satan ngqwamedung penui au Jewme lie rangla, dede penui au ma, meliene penui au kenretme, Pielo, Ih penuide peu gwang eh n pi dwaga keumie zie, ciciu eh Ih ncu hungla lie kecu penui cilu zie. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Nang lia sünne eh bamlu kera a sam kaizeu kelune, kideu ga lungh kebamme de kedei kera, kehedei kideu pelane ga kegwang tingdau, Ih de ncu gum luzie. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ih kelwa gwang zeu. N da kebam de herak ntiplu, iciu eh migede n hegwang peurwa süt teudi melu kerane. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Ngkieng kelube de, Ih a Tinggwang kerecaki ga pecu hetsia ge tei beuzie. Pa cikade madau gede tet mpetdi lak, nah Ih pereu gage a Tinggwang zi rau gaizie, a Tinggwang namdi zi (Jerusalem keheci, a Tinggwang dade tinggim gade kehung de), nah a zi keheci de. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang Rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo.”’”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laodicea ga ngqwabe dage kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Laodicea namdi ga ngqwabe samgwabe dage rau gailu: ‘Aide Amen,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amen: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Khrista de rangbam nah pekie cai, Khrista au Tinggwang mariem nah sampet pelane tei kebeu de (2 Cor. 1:20) </char></note> nlumlu kebuibe nah zierang kesangbe, Tinggwang damkegai bangdwabe rangzeu: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“Ih n batadung ci, nang au ngkung mede lum de ma. Ih ncu peu ngkung mede lum neu! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Dede, nang au lumlwak kebamne—lum de ma mede ngkung de kemakne—Ih ncu a mui gade nlwak mpetdi lai zeu da. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Kedanemene nang rang, ‘Ih au mahei bam, Ih au mabam kekiee ge bam, nah Ih magede teu si maisia meda.’ Dede nang au reisüt, mi nggia teilung lungh, magah, miakcit nah paaula kebam nang ci ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:8">Hos. 12:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Cine nang a dade kecak mi gade teimci kelude luilu, ciciude nang mahei luzie, nah paiheni keha luilu, ciciude nang paini teulu eh nang paaula kebam ne hengngam ngau melu kerane, nah maca n miak püt kerane luilu, ciciude nang mangau luzie. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Ih hung kelame leune de Ih kesiu nah ledeula. Cine, laikai teilu nah helungnreu lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Mac. 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Ainie, Ih kikam ga sap eh ketung bam lie. Mina keheibe de a kwa siulu eh kikam ngkei beucai, Ih peda lüt eh pecu ngngwa matyei zie, nah pa acu ngngwa matyei zie. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Ngkieng kelube de, Ih a hegwangbam ga peu pecu acu ngngwa bam zie, Ih de ngkieng lu eh a Pei de ngngwa pe hegwangbam ga bam kelu nzwa. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Pekwen kebambe de peu Tinggwang Rabe ngqwamedung dage kerang de kingnei lulo.”’”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Tinggim ga hegwangbam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Ma aidungde cai Ih piegai, nah ainie, Tinggim ga kikam ge ngkei pwa bam! Ih makwa siu raitu de telui kwa ge nzwa acu mpau eh ranggai, “Aika hanglu, iciude ma aidungde cai teigwang kerabe Ih ncu lia zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:6">Keu. 22:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Zette Tinggwang Rabe acu kezeu teudi, nah ainie, tinggim ga hegwangbam ge kai zeu! Nah hegwangbam ga mige ntumbam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:19">1 Heg. 22:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Cika ntum kebambe de tangtsu pemi kewhung jasper nah carnelian nzwa. Tangningnaria tangtsu pemi kewhung emerald kenzwa ge ne hegwangbam de twagwa pwa bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Eze. 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Hegwangbam de hegwangbam ngkaiemdai ne twagwa pung bam, nah hegwangbamdung ga hangkiame ngkaiemdai, paiheni keha bah, nah kecak peurwa punglwe ntumbam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:16">Keu. 11:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Hegwangbam gade tingkehepik kebaa, nah tingceu kengyim kecu kwadung pet. Hegwangbam dwa ga mitaubung hena ntau pwa bam, cidungde au Tinggwang rabe henadung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zec. 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Hegwangbam dwa ga jaaidi zudageu kenzwa ge, crystal tsu nzwa mcigi bam. Hegwangbam sum ga, nah hegwangbam tu lule ailam ringkela kaune mdai, pedwa pecai pemiak puipung lwe twagwa bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:12">Eze. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ringkela kaune keraibe cai hingho ge nzwa, ringkela kaune pekenabe cai hetumna ge nzwa, nah ringkela kaune pekecumbe cai mina zu ge nzwa, nah ringkela kaune pemdaibe cai helie limkela ge nzwa. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Ringkela kaune mdaidung de pe hesiu herok bam kap, hegwale nah helungle de pemiakdung le puipung. Penui tingmui tingba mtak mene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">“Mci, mci mci Ngkiengtube Rampaube Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">ndaa de kelabe, cude kebambe nah gwangdai kerabe de,” de rang bamla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:2-3">Lei. 6:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ringkela kaunedung, kelungta ringla kelabe, hegwangbam ga kebambe de kendu, kerüt nah hetwa kepeu dau,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dan. 12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />hangkiamedung ngkaiemdai de, hegwangbam ga kebambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang</char></note> dwaga keumie delwe kelungta ring kelabe de reca. Penui hegwangbam dwa gage penui hegwang peurwa lwakgai eh ranggai,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 47:8">Lei. 47:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Anui Rampaube nah anui Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">nang au kendu, hetwa nah kengkieng ngaulu kebuibe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">kedanemene nang ma pelane damgai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">nah n lungning gade cidungde de damgai nah lunghlu.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Laisiudum nah meurünna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Pecai hegwangbam ga kebambe ba zetle bie ga laisiudum ge pedwa nah pecaile marau pwa kebam ge bam eh Ih ngau, cide kaugiak hena gele giak pwabam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9-10">Eze. 2:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Nah kengkieng tinggimgwame ge sahbak eh, “Caube ne laisiudum de nah pe kaugiak de let nah rapop lubui no?” de reci kecu Ih ngau. <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Dede tinggim ga mede kideu reu ga mede kideu kangga migede laisiudum de letlu kera mede cide peilu kera gahdi. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Cine Ih hap sütti kedanemene migede laisiudum de letlu kera mede cide peilu kebui gah kedine. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Dede hangkiame hange a dage ranggai, “Hap so. Ainie! Judah leuhme Hingho, David Kiriabe ne ngam luda. Pa laisiudum de nah pe kaugiak henadung de let lubui.” <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Pecai hegwangbam sum ga nah ringkela kaune mdai kakga nah hangkiamedung kakga, Meurünna pecu teitset kedi nzwa eh sap kebam Ih ngau. Pa pekii hena nah pemiak hena bam, cidungde kideu pelane gage Tinggwang Rabe henadung lang mpet kegaidung deda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zec. 4:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Pa mie delwe hegwang bam ga kebambe ba zetle gade laisiudum de keulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Keu. 5:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Pa laisiudum de keu kelucai, ringkela kaune mdaidung de nah hangkiame hang ngkaiemdaidung de Meurünnabe dwa ga keumie di. Penui hangge ge kecu leibung nah marim kehengui le kepui kecak kwak ge pwa bam, cidungde kemcime kekiedung. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Penui lei keheci ge teigai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Nang laisiudum de keulwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kaugiak cide letlu kebuibe lie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">Kedanemene ncu daptsetdi, nah n jai le nang Tinggwang ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">pautsa, helet, mina, nah heleuh leune gade mina de lui luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:12">Keu. 5:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Nang penuide anui Tinggwang dage hegwangram ge nah cingkumedung teibeu dida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">nah penui kideu reu di zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:6">Keu. 1:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Pecai Ih piegai ge hegwangbam nah ringkela kaunedung nah hangkiamedung de twagwa pwa kebam tinggimgwame kekiee kwa siu. Penui riak au cang kerei kecu cang kerei kieege nah pecang pecang bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan. 7:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Penui sahbak eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 5:12">“Meurünna daptset kedibe de kengkieng, mahei, maci, kengking, herüt, kendu nah hetwa ngaulu kebuibe lie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:9">Keu. 5:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Pecai dam kegai leune, tinggim ga nah kideu reuga nah kideu kangga, nah jaaidi ga nah cika kebam pelane cu,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 5:13">“Hegwangbam ga kebambe nah Meurünnabe de peu kelungta twa nah rüt, nah ndu nah ngkieng kelube tei lulo,” de kecu Ih siu.<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Nah ringkela kaune mdai de, “Amen!” degai nah hangkiamedung keumie delwe Meurünnabe de recadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">hangkiamedung ngkaiemdai keukeimie lu eh kelungta ring kelabe de recadi.</char> </note><verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Kaugiakdung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Pecai Meurünnabe kaugiak hena gade ket paube let kegai <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kaugiak hena gade ket paube let kegai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide kaugiak raitube mede hegwatube </char></note>dau Ih piegai, nah ringkela kaune mdai kakgade hangge tingceukwa kenzwa gade, “Gwanglu!” de eh kerang Ih siu. <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Cine Ih piegai, ge ainie hekwen keha ge bam! Cipau reu ga kebambe lakpi ge pwala, nah pecu hegwang peurwa ge peu. Pa ngamlukelabe ge tei eh ngamlu zielie tet petdi.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Meurünnabe kaugiak pekenabe de let kegai dau, ringkela kaune pekenabe, “Gwanglu!” de eh kerang Ih siu. <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Pecai hekwen kedage pet—gierei ge. Pereu cwa kelabe de kideu gade kezuyi keuteu di kera kengkieng pwapeu, ciciu eh minadung hangge hangge de teitsetlu kerane. Pecu kingtie kedi ge pwapeu.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Meurünnabe kaugiak pekecumbe de let kegai dau, ringkela kaune pekecumbe, “Gwanglu!” de eh kerang Ih siu. Ih piegai, ge ainie, hekwen ketiak ge bam! Pereu cwa kelabe pe ba ga riateukwak ge pwala. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Pecai ringkela kaune mdaidung kakgade makwa ge, “Wheat choenix ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Choenix ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Liter 1.10 kenzwage </char></note> mi denarius ket,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denarius ket: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tingnai ge ziehi</char></note> nah barley choenice kecum mi de denarius ket. Dede macaa nah zau de au ngkap diso,” de eh kerang Ih siu.<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Pecai meurünnabe kaugiak pemdaibe de let kegai dau, ringkela kaune pe mdaibe, “Gwanglu!” de eh kerang Ih siu. <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Pecai Ih piegai, ge ainie hekwen hamda ge bam! Pereu cwa kelabe zi au Ketsai, nah Hades <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hades: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ketsaime deu</char></note> pecai sui la. Penai de kideu zi mdai zi ge reu kengkieng peu, kingtie, nah herakum, nah mateei, nah kideu ga renaamkaune de teu eh teitset kera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2-3">Jer. 15:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Pecai meurünnabe kaugiak pemengeibe de let kegai dau, Tinggwang sam ziemne nah penui zierang de ga masang kebam ziemne teitset kedime rabedung recabam kangga kebam Ih ngau. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Penui sahbak eh ranggai, “Ma pelane reu kedibo, mci nah kesangbo, nang kideu ga kelunghme tutiak kera nah nang anuide teitset kedime kum pei kera peting daitie ge zie reuno?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:5-6">Keu. 16:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Pecai penui hangge ge de paiha pwa peu, nah penuide peting kieekemak ge kwagai rielo rangbeu, penuide ngngwa hebaang keteimedung nah penui sinamedungde de penuide teitset kedi nzwa, teitset canglu kemaktane.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Pecai meurünnabe kaugiak peherokbe de let kegai dau, Ih piegai ge nnuih teu sütdi. Tingnaimiak rosopai mamai le tei kelu nzwa tiakti, nah hekei bungri de hejai nzwadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe. 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 29:6">Isa. 29:6</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag. 2:6</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:8">Mrk. 13:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Tinggim gade hegidung kideu ga cakmiedi, tangzüttsi meu kemakbe rahang tingkai gui kelai kegai dau tangzüttsibang gade cakmie di kela nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat. 24:29</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 13:25">Mrk. 13:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Laisiudum kezuidi kela nzwa tingkam gahdi. Lamlwa nah duigwadeu leune pebam gade mlai tetdi. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Pecai kideu ga hegwangmedung, nah mina kenlangme, nah reugwa kedime, nah makeheime, nah kengkiengme, nah keheibe de, hebaangme nah kemakme tsupopdung nah lamlwa ga tsuradung kakga gwang mbaidi. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Penui lamlwadung nah tsuradung dage rangdi, “Anui reu ga cakmie lo! Anuide Hegwangbam ga kebambe dwagade nah Meurünnabe lunghop gade kebai beulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk. 23:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Kedanemene penai lunghop tingba kedi de gwang bamdi delu, nah caune cide lialu laino?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal. 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:11">Joe. 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="NAM 1:6">Nah. 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="ZEP 1:14-15">Zep. 1:14-15</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal. 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Giakkelu 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Aipau cai tinggimgwame hang mdai kideu kung mdai ga sap kebam Ih ngau, kideu kaigui mdaidung swapung lu eh, iciu eh kideu reu ga, mede jaaidi, mede tsingbang gede tingkai guilwa melu kerane. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Pecai naimiak kepetle de tinggimgwame kedage gwangkela Ih ngau, pa ringkela Tinggwang gu kaugiak pwala. Pa kideube nah jaaidi de tei keherei kera kengkieng kepeu tinggimgwame hang mdai bau dage sahbak eh, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />ranggai, “Anui anui Tinggwang kilame de penui sipiedung gage kaugiak giaklu kemaktane kideu, mede jaaidi, mede tsingbangdung de tei ngkap diso.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eze. 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Nah Ih kaugiak giak kelume riak daikie ge bi kecu siu: Israel leuh pelane gade kaugiak giak kelume 144,000:<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Judah leuh gade cang kereiekena de giaklu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">Reuben leuh gade cang kereiekena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">Gad leuh gade cang kereiekena,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Asher leuh gade cang kereiekena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">Naphtali leuh gade cang kereiekena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">Manasseh leuh gade cang kereiekena,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Simeon leuh gade cang kereiekena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">Levi leuh gade cang kereiekena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">Issachar leuh gade cang kereiekena,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Zebulun leuh gade cangkereiekena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">Joseph leuh gade cang kereiekena, nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">Benjamin leuh gade cang kereiekena de giaklu.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paiha teukebam maadi ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Aipau cai Ih piegai, ge ainie hemaa maadi ge migede peikap gai kelak ge bam—heleuh pelane, mina pelane, nah helet leune gade—hegwangbam dwaga nah Meurünnabe dwaga sap bam. Penui paini keha bah nah penui ba ga palm kiakdung pwala, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />nah penui sahbak eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:10">“Kelikelu hegwangbam ga kebambe anui Tinggwang, nah Meurünnabe da la!”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Nah tinggimgwame pelane hegwangbam, hangkiamedung nah ringkela kaunedung mdai de sap twagwa bam, nah hegwangbam dwaga keumie delwe Tinggwang de reca eh, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />ranggai,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:12">“Amen!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amen: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sam aide, rang kegai sam de kesangbe lie eh ngkiengsüt eh keulia bam.</char></note> ketwa nah kendu nah maci nah hetwakepeu nah kerüt nah kengkieng nah kengking de anui Tinggwang da lamui kelube teilo! Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Pecai hangkiame ge acu keteu eh ranggai, “Paini keha bah kebam aidungde caudung no, nah penui dai gade gwang no?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Cine Ih pe dage ranggai, “A mpaubo, nang ne ci lie.” Pecai pa a dage ranggai, “Aidungde au kehereisüt kecu gade kwak gwang kelumedung lie. Penui penui painidung heta luda nah cidungde Meurünna jai gade tei ha luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:14">Keu. 22:14</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb. 9:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Aide ziemne, penui Tinggwang hegwangbam dwaga bam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">nah penui pe kerecaki gade pecu tingmui tingba reca bam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">Hegwangbam ga kebambe pe paiki lim pwa penuide gum luzie.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Penui mzeu dai lakta, mede penui hereu dai lakta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">mede tingnaimiak ne penuide puteei lak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">mede kelum ne de puteei lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa. 49:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Kedanemene Meurünna hegwangbam sum ga kebambe ne penuide kekwabe tei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">nah pa penuide kering duipwakdung gage ngngwa gaibeu zie,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1-2">Lei. 23:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa. 25:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:17">nah Tinggwang penui miak gade miakdui leune neu gi dizie.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Kaugiak henabe nah kecak kwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Meurünnabe kaugiak pehenabe de let kegai dau, tinggim ga bamdakkak piege kenzwa ge zing de bamdi. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Pecai Ih tinggimgwame hang hena Tinggwang dwaga sap kebam ngau, nah telui hena penuide pwapeu.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Tinggimgwame kedage, marim kehengui kecak kwak ge pwalwe gwang marim kehengui recabam ga saplu. Marim kehengui kekiee ge pecu peugai ciciude pa kemcime pelane kekiedung si eh hegwangbam dwaga kebam marim kehengui kecak recabam gage reca gailu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:8">Keu. 5:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Marim kehengui mika de, kemcime kekiedung si eh tinggimgwabe ba gade Tinggwang dwaga cuhdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Lei. 141:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Pecai tinggimgwabe marim kehengui kwak de pwalwe recabam gade cide mi le kai puilu. Pecai pa cide kideu gage kelien miegai, ge tingceu kengyim, tinghepik, nah nnuihteudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:5">Keu. 4:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teluidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Pecai tinggimgwame hang hena telui hena pwa kebamdung de cidungde kwagai kera mteilu.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Tinggimgwabe keraibe pe telui kwagai, ge tangheu nah mi hejai ncütlu. Cide kideu gage kelien nghung gai, nah kideu zicum zi ge rudi, tsingbangdung zicum zi ge rudi, nah tsehei kemdiak pelane rudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:22">Eze. 38:22</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung kesa ga, </char><char style="fqa">nah kideu zicum tei eh zi ge rudi, de kecu de si ma.</char></note><verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pekenabe pe telui kwagai, nah lamlwa kedi heu kebam kenzwage jaaidi gage kelien gai. Jaaidi zicum zi ge hejai mmi di,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hejai mmi di: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hejai nzwadi, hejai nzwa giedi.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />jaaidi ga lungh kebam kaunedung zicum zi ge tsaidi, nah liemdung zicum zi ge tei msiadi.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pekecumbe pe telui kwagai, ge tinggim gade hegi kedi ge, helei nzwa heu eh cak miedi, nah cide kereukidung nah duirwakdung zicum zi ge reu ga cak miedi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:13">Keu. 6:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Hegi zi au Wormwood.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wormwood: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide kekaa tsehei kendiak hei ge</char></note> Dui zicum zi ge kaadi, nah mina kekiee ge dui kaa kedi de saklwe tsaidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Jer. 9:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pemdaibe pe telui kwagai, ge tingnaimiak zicum zi ge, nah hekei zicum zi ge, nah hegidung zicum zi ge de samdi, ciciu eh cidungde zicum zi ge muidi. Tingba zicum zi ge baa tadi, nah tingmui de cinzwadi.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Pecai Ih piegai ge, mipeu reule lim kela helie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">helie </char> de mene <char style="fqa">samgwame, de eh bam.</char></note> ge sahbak eh kerang Ih siu, “Ainie, ainie, ainie, kideu ga lungh kebammedung da keherei gwang zieda, kedanemene tinggimgwame hangcum cude penui telui kwa kwagai laizeu reulu.”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pemengeibe pe telui kwagai, ge tinggim gade hegi ge kideu ga cak kemie Ih ngau. Hegi de de penli kegah hekwa kecok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Penli kegah hekwa kecok: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide kideu kecok ga herakesiabe rabedung de baang pwa kebam nide de rangbam, (Luk. 8:31)</char></note> cabi de peudi. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Pa penli kegah hekwa kecok de ngkeigai, ge cikade mika mimang kedi ge mika nzwa kapet. Hekwa gade kepet mikade ne tingnaimiak nah tingkai de tei muidi. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Pecai mika gade tangrimdung kideube reu ga gwang, nah penuide kideube ga heruingapuidung kengkieng nzwa kengkieng pwapeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:5">Keu. 9:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Penuide kideu reu tsehei kemdiak, mabang kemdiak mede tsingbang gede tei msiadi helo, dede Tinggwang kaugiak penui sipie gage giak kemakme de rünne ngkapdi lulo rangbeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:4">Keu. 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Tangriemdung de penuide teitset kera peu ma, dede penuide kei mengei ge teikeherei kera rünne pwapeu. Penui rei au heruingapui ge ne mide ngki dige teei kela nzwa zie. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Cipau kei mengei tingdau minadung ketsai peei zie, dede cide ngaugai lak. Penui tsai neusüt dizie, dede ketsai penui dade pak dizie. <verse eid="REV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Tangrimdung rehi au hekwendung hereu tei kerane mtei pwakebam nzwada. Penui peu ga kecak hegwang peurwa kenzwadung ge pungla, nah penui zu au mina zu nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:4">Joe. 2:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Penui peutam mipuime peutam nzwa, nah penui gei hingho gei nzwa. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Penui hekarakcumdung hegeu hekarakcumdung nzwa, nah penui hesiu kwa au hekwen kekiee ge bagi teulwe hereu ga pak kelwet kwa nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Joe. 1:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Penui heruingapuidung nzwa penui mi ga penui keu bam, nah kei mengei ge minadung de tei rezam kera penui mi ga kengkieng bam. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Penli kegah hekwa kecok samgwabe penui reu hegwang teibam. Pe zi Hebrew let gade Abaddon,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abaddon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide pekie, “kengkap” mede “kengkap ni.” </char></note> nah Greek let gade pezi Apollyon lie qula.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Nreikeiketei keraibe au cang dida. Ainie! Aipau cai de nreikeiketei kena gwang si zie reu.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Pecai tinggimgwabe peherokbe pe telui kwagai, ge Tinggwang dwaga kebam kecak recabam kii mdai gade makwa ge Ih siu. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Makwa de telui pwa kebam tinggimgwabe peherokbe dage ranggai, “Euphrates Reuki kedi gage baang pwa kebam tinggimgwame hang mdai de lungmpet dilu.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Cine tinggimgwame hangmdai cipau bamdakkak, cipau tingba, cipau kei, nah cipau mmi de ziemne mteilwe kebamme de lungmpetdi, iciu eh penui mina zicum zi ge de teitsetlu kerane. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Hekwen cwa kela reugwame riak cai 200,000,000. Ih penui riak aide siu. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ih marengei gade hekwendung nah pereu cwa kelame de ainzwa ngau: penui hekarakcum gierei, mzai, nah sulfur nzwa nzien. Hekwendung peu hinghodung peu nzwa, nah penui muidung gade mi, mika, nah sulfur pet. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Tei keherei kecu kecum penui mui gade kepet mi, mika, nah sulfur aidungde ne mina zicum zi ge de teitsetdi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Kedanemene hekwendung kengkieng au penui muidung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hekwendung kengkieng au penui muidung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cidecai, mi, mika, nah sulfur penui mui gade kepet de de rangbam.</char></note> nah penui midung ga kebamne—penui midung heneidung nzwa penui peu bam, nah cidungde le penui minadung de tei rezam la. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Mina kedamedung, keherei aidungde ne teitset kemakmedung, penui batadung gade helungnreulu ma, mede herakesiadung nah kecak, rangkanggeu, hetageu, tangtsu, nah tsing le teikelu mamiedung—ma ngau kemak, mede siu kemak, mede tetgai kelak miedungde kereca mtak ma. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Mede penui mide dapketset, mede penui rekata, mede penui kemmha ta, mede penui kerega batadung gade helungnreu luma.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Tinggimgwabe nah laisiudum keceu nade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Aipau cai tinggimgwame keda ngkiengsüt kecu ge tinggim gade nghung kela Ih ngau. Pecu hemwa ge gage kezui nah pe peu reu ga tangningnaria ge la. Pezu au tingnaimiak nzwa nah pe pi au mi tsiadung nzwa. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Pa peba ga laisiudum keceuna ge let pwakebam ge bam. Pa pe pi zetle jaaidi reu ga sap nah pe pi hile hangdeu reu ga sap. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Pecai pa hingho kemra nzwa sahbak gai. Pa sah gaige, tingceu henadung de mra eh keligai. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Tingceu kwa henadung de mra gaige, Ih rau kera teilu, dede Ih tinggim gade makwa ge siu, “Tingceu henadung kerang de ngkim nzeulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngkim nzeulu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cide pekie cai, pa cidung de rau nzeu kerabe ma, dede pa siu kelude pekatei peda kaizeu lu kerabe, cide kaugiak teipang kelakbe kangga ge kai nzeu kecu nzwa.</char></note> Cide rau so.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Pecai tinggimgwabe jaaidi reu ga nah kideu reu ga sap kebam Ih kengaube de pe ba zetle tinggim lam ge hwagai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:40">Hez. 32:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Pa kelungta ringla kelabe, tinggim nah cika kebam leune, kideu nah cika kebam leune, jaaidi nah cika kebam leune, dam kegaibe zi gade sampet eh cu, “Tinggwang kekwa ting de cang dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:11">Keu. 4:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Dede tinggimgwabe pehenabe marang kegai tingdau, pa pe telui kwagai kera dau, cidau Tinggwang lungning kecok de pa pe kilame caihakecime dage samliakeyi rang kebeu nzwa teicang luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang lungning kecok de teicang luzie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aika pekie cai, Tinggwang kaa kegai mede kesangbe lia kegai de, nah pedwa mina da ranglia kemak de rangbam.</char></note>” <verse eid="REV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Pecai tinggim gade Ih makwa kesiu de a dage rang dai eh cu: “Mie, tinggimgwabe jaaidi nah kideu reu ga sap kebambe ba gade laisiudum let pwa kebam keceuna de keulu.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Cine Ih tinggimgwabe da mie acu laisiudum keceuna de peu lo ranggai. Pa a dage rangdi, “Cide keulu delwe tyeilu. Cide nza tei kaa dizie, dede cide n mui gade au heliadui nzwa kum zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:1-3">Eze. 3:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Cine Ih tinggimgwabe ba gade laisiudum keceuna de keulu delwe cide tyeilu. Cide amui gade heliadui nzwa kum, dede Ih cide tyei luge, aza tei kaadi. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ge tinggimgwame ge a dage rangdi, “Nang mina maadung, heleuhdung, heletdung, nah hegwangdung ha cairasam rangdai maisia da.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Zierang hangna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Pecai acu hetuitie, kemdet geutie kenzwa ge peu. Acu rangbeu, “Cuhlu delwe Tinggwang kerecaki nah recabam, nah cika reca kebamedung de mdet lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:1">Zec. 2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Dede kerecaki gwalebie kebam kigu de siso, nah cide mdet so, kedanemene cide Jewme kemakme de peudi delu. Penui kemci namdi de kei riakdaiekena ge pidau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kengkieng teuzie </char></note> teizie. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nah Ih a zierangme kenade kengkieng peu zie, delwe penai tingbazie 1,260 ge rosopai bah eh caihakecisam rangzie.” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Aikenade au olive bang kena nah kideu reu Rampaube dwa ga kesap mitaubungbam kena deda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zec. 4:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Mina keheibe de penaide tei rezam kera tei cai, penai mui gade mi pet eh penai ngauraume de ngkap dizie. Mina keheibe de penaide tei rezam kera cet cai, pecu ainzwa eh teitset dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:14">Jer. 5:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Penai tinggim ngkuilu kera kengkieng bam, ciciu eh penai caihakecisam kerang tingdau tingrui melu kerane. Penai duidung de hejai tei mmi dilu kera nah penai keheidau de keneu dau keherei ketsamtsam teu kideube de kedeu kera kengkieng bam. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Penai zierang teicang dide, penli kegah hekwa kecok gade kempet teikuu de penaide ngngwa regi zie. Pa penaide ngamlwe penaide teitset dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:7">Keu. 13:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Namdi kedi puidi gage penai paaube kaizeu dizie (cide de Sodom nah Egypt lie qula) cikage penai Rampaube dede gwaktset. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Mina hepui, helet, nah heleuh leune gade tingba zie langcumne eh pepie ge penai paau de piezie, nah penai paau herau gage peu kai dilak. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Nah kideu ga lungh kebamme penai ziemne penui suiyi sützie nah renga dizie. Penui hangge ge de mapeu peuzie kedanemene caihakeci aipau kenade ne kideu ga kelunghme de tei kehereisüt kecu ziemne. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Dede langcumne eh pepie cai Tinggwang dade penai da keringcuingi lwetdi, nah penai cuhsap dailu, nah penaide kengaume ngngisüt di. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Pecai penui tinggim gade makwa ge sahbak eh penaide kerang siu, “Aika nghanglu!” Pecai penai ngauraume penaide pie eh kebam dau penai hemwa gade tinggim ga nghang di. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Cipau bamdakkak ga nnuih kedige teudi, nah namdibe zi kerei zige kaudi. Nnuih keteu gade mina cang hena de teitsetdi, nah bangkelumedung ngngisütdi nah tinggim ga kebam Tinggwang de kendu peu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:7">Keu. 14:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Nreikeiketei pekenabe gwang dida. Ainie! Nreikeiketei pekecumbe de kelwa gwang zeu.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Telui henabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pehenabe pe telui kwagai, nah tinggim gade makwadung sahbak eh rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:15">“Kideu hegwangram de anui Rampaube nah pe Khrista hegwangram dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:15">nah pa kelungta hegwang tei lamui dizie.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Pecai hangkiame ngkaiemdai, Tinggwang dwa ga penui hegwangbamdung ga kebamme, penui zu keumie Tinggwang de reca eh <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Ngkiengtube Rampaube Tinggwang, cude nah ndaa de kelabe, anui ncu twala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">kedanemene nang n kengkieng kedi de teulu eh hegwang tei cuh kedine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Keu. 1:8</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung </char><char style="fqa">pelane reu hegwangbe, cude, nah ndaa de nah gwang kelabe, de eh peila</char> dede keheci laisiudung kekiee ge cinzwa peila ma. </note><verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Nlum kemakme rata le pui dida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">dede n lunghop gwang dida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nah ketsaime de tiak kera ting,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">nah nang n kilame, caihakecimedung, nah kemcimedung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nah n zi de rüt kelame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">kedime nah keceume de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ziehi peu kera ting gwang bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Nah kideu de ngkap kelamedung de ngkapti kera ting gwang bam dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:5">Keu. 19:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Pecai Tinggwang kerecaki tinggim ga kebam de ngkeigai nah samkakbung de cika kebam Ih ngau. Cika tinghepik, tingceu kengyim, nnuihteu, nah tangheukei sütdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:5">Keu. 15:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mipuibe nah neidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Pecai tinggim ga marehi tsamsüt kecu ge petdi: mipui ge tingnaimiak le pe paini tei, nah hekei le pe pidau tei, nah pe peu ga hegi kereiekena kebam peurwa gela. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Pa au tetlakla, nah pa hena tedteei teei eh hap bam, nah mna kera keherei eh bam. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Pecai tinggim ga marehi kedage petdi: Ainie, neidi kegie disüt kecu ge, pe peu hena nah pe kii kerei, nah pe peudung ga hegwangpeurwa gege la. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Nah pe mi tinggim ga hegidung zicum zige biak gidi eh kideu gage kelien nghung gaidi. Neidi de mna lai eh kebam mipui de dwa ga saplu, iciu eh pa mna lude, pa pe na de tuityei lu kerane. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Pecai pa mipei nage de mnalu, hegeutie teu heleuh pelane reu kedi tei kerabe de. Pe na de neidi de dade Tinggwang nah pe hegwangbam ga süt teu gwangdi, <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />nah mipui de hetaideu gage pak gaidi, cika pa Tinggwang ne heni mtei kebeu ge bam, ciciu eh pecu tingba zie 1,260 ge pe ma pielu kerane.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Cu tinggim ga hereu teidi. Michael nah pe samgwamedung neidi de ngngwa regi; ge neidi nah pe samgwamedung de ngngwa regi gwadi. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Neidi de de ngamlu, nah pa nah pe samgwame de peu tinggim ga bamsi tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:11">Keu. 12:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Cine neidi kedi dede kelien ngkeidi—ndaa henei de,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ndaa henei de: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide henei Eve de cwa kedi de de rangbam. </char></note> herakesiabe nah Satan lie qu kelabe, kideu pelane de cwa kedibe de—pecu kideu gage kelien gaidi, nah pecu ngngwa pe samgwamedung dede kelien ngkeidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Jhn. 12:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Pecai tinggim gade makwa sahbak eh kerang Ih siu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">“Cu au kelikelu nah kengkieng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nah anui Tinggwang hegwang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nah Khrista kengkieng gwang bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">Kedanemene anui sinamedung de mmau kelabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mmau kelabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">herakesiabe</char></note> de kelien nghungdi delu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">tingmui tingba anui Tinggwang dwa gade penuide mmau bam kelabe de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Keu. 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Penui Meurünna jai nah penui zierang ketei sam gade pecu ngam luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:11">kedanemene penui ketsai kecangde penui teilung hungdi kemakne.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Cine tinggimme nnui suiyi lulo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">nah cika lungh kebam pelane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">Dede ainie kideube nah jaaidi da keherei gwang zieda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kedanemene herakesiabe nnuida nghungdi delu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">Pa au rata kehing le puipung bam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kedanemene pa peda peting kecamnage kebam ci kecune!” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:13">Keu. 8:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Neidi de pecu kideu gage kelien nghung kedi cilu ge, pa mipeina de mna kelube puide de gwazui miedi. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Dede mipui de helie kedi hesiu kena peu, iciu eh pe bam hetaideu gage limgwang gailu kerane, cika pecu mmi kecum eh pepie ge pema pie nah heneibe dwagade kwaklu kerane. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Henei pemui gade dui hereuki ge nzwa mipui de cai gage teilwa mpetgai, iciu eh pa pecu peu duikedi le diapung gidi lu kerane. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Dede kideube mipui de nghabeu. Kideube pemui ngkei lwe neidi pemui gade kereuki rui mpet kegai de mneu pwadi. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Cidau neidi de mipui de pe rata sütdi nah pe name kedamedung, Tinggwang sam kemzaime nah Jisu zierang keteimedung de ngngwa hereu tei kera tetdi. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Pecai neidi jaaidi kung heciang reu ga saplu. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga aipau samria de perwak 13:1 raitu gage kaila, dede laisiudung yitube aika perwak 12:18 gage kaila. </char></note><verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Jaaidi gade kempet kau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Pecai Ih teikuu ge jaaidi gade mpetkela ngau. Cide pe kii kerei nah pe peu hena bam. Pe kiidung ga hegwangpeurwa kerei bam, nah pe peureu ga Tinggwang de rangkemsia zige laciau. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Cu Ih teikuu kengau aide heradi kaudauna ge nzwa. Pepi hegum pi nzwa, nah pemui hingho mui nzwa. Cide de neidi ne pe kengkieng, nah pe hegwangbam, nah hegwang tei kera kengkieng kedi peu. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Teikuu peu ket rezam msiasüt teu kela nzwa ngau, dede pe rezam zam de yi dailu. Kideube pelane penui swagah eh teikuu cai suila. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Penui pelane neidide de reca, kedanemene pa pe kengkieng teikuu de peu kedine. Penui makaune de reca eh ranggai, “Cau teikuu de nzwano?” nah “Cau pecu renia lubui no?” <verse eid="REV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Teikuu de ngangkela samdung nah Tinggwang de rangkemsia sam ranglukebui mui ge pwapeu, nah pecu kei riakdaiekena kengkieng teulu kebui peu. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Cine teikuu Tinggwang de rangmsia kera, pe zi, pa kelungh ni, nah tinggim ga lungh kebamme de rangmsia kerane pemui ngnga lu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Teikuu de peu kemcimedung de ngngwa hereu tei eh penuide ngamlukera peu. Delwe cide de hepui, helet, minadung nah heleuh pelane reu kengkieng pwapeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan. 7:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Kideu ga kelungh leune cide de reca zie, kideu damkelu gade, Meurünna daptset kedibe, Kering Laisiukwak gage pezi raulu kemakme leune de. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Keheibe de pekwen bamcai, pecu peu kingnei lulo.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Tui kerame keheibe de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">tui teudi zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">Keheibe de kingtie le mide teitset kelame de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kingtie le pecu teitsetdi maisia.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Aide kemcimedung de lia lulo nah nlum bam lulo rang kelia da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:12">Keu. 14:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Pecai Ih teikuu kedage kideu gade pet kela ngau. Cide meurünna nzwa kiina bam, nah cide neidi nzwa marang. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Teikuu pe kenabe de teikuu keraibe dwagade pe kengkieng pelane teu delwe kideu ga lungh kebamme depeu teikuu keraibe de recadi—pe rezam zam yi kelube de. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Cide miswakegah bata kedidung teigai, pa minadung dwagade mi tinggim gade kideu gage cakmie kecu de teigai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:24-29">1 Heg. 18:24-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Teikuu keraibe zi gade mimakecang tadung teilu kebui kepeu gade pa kideu ga kelunghme de cwadi. Teikuu pekenabe kideu ga kelunghme de teikuu keraibe rezam di eh yi kelube ziemne mamie tei lulo rangbeu. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Teikuu pekenabe de peu teikuu keraibe mie gage keringcui ngngi gai kera teibeu, iciu eh peu teikuu mie de maranglu kerane, nah teikuu mie de reca kemakme leune de teitsetdi kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:5">Dan. 3:5</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 3:6">6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Cide mina leune, keceume nah kedime, keheime nah kegahme, mibaang keteime nah kemakme de penui ba zetle mede penui sipie gage kaugiak de giaklu kera ketang. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Nah cine kaugiak de giaklu mecai migede malui mede mazwa gailak—cide teikuu zi, mede pezi kaupei. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Aide maci lulo rang kelia: Maci kebambe de peu teikuu kaupei de peilu. Kedanemene cide mina kaupei da, nah pe kaupei de au 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Meurünna nah 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Pecai Ih piegai, ge Zion Deutu ga Meurünna sap bam. Pecu ngngwa mina 144,000 pe zi nah pe Pei zi penui sipie gage raulwe bam. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nah Ih tinggim gade dui kekiee ge kwa nzwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dui kekiee ge kwa nzwa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dui kedi kwa nzwa, cide pe kwa ci zu eh tinggim gade kideu ga kecang siu cang. </char></note> nah tingceu süt kecu kwa nzwa siu. Ih makwa kesiude leibung kekwame penui leibung kwa kecu kwa nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:2">Eze. 43:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Nah penui hegwangbam nah ringkela kaunedung mdai nah hangkiamedung dwa gade lei keheci ge tei. Lei cide kideu gade rikelumedung 144,000 de gwale migede tei cilu ma. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Aidungde mipui de ngngwa eh penuikatei penuide tei heradi kemakmedung, penui au penuide kai mci kelume kecune. Penui, Meurünna kemie leu ga sui kelamedung. Aidungde mina kakgade, Tinggwang nah Meurünna ziemne petsi raitubedung tei eh rikelumedung da. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Penui mui gade kenret gede ngaulu ma, kedanemene penui au kemau kegahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Tinggwang hegwangbam dwaga, de kaisi.</char> </note><verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggimgwame Hangcum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Pecai Ih tinggimgwame kedage ting sum ga limla eh ngau, pe da kideu ga kelunghme ziemne kelungta kela samliakeyi de ranglia beu kera de la—heleuh, hepui, helet, nah mina leune dage. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Pa sahbak eh ranggai, “Tinggwang de hinglu nah pecu kendu peulo. Kedanemene pa mina tutiak kera ting gwang bamdi delu. Tinggim, kideu, jaaidi, nah duirwakdung tei kegaibe de reca lulo.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Tinggimgwame kedage, pekenabe, pecai de rang eh, “Kau dida, kau dida Babylon kedi de, heleuhdung pelane de peu pe kemmha zau gade sak kera penui lung tei kebeube de.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Tinggimgwame kedage, pekecumbe, penai caide marang sahbak eh ranggai, “Keheibe de teikuu de nah pe mie de reca cai, nah pe sipie mede peba ga kaugiak de giakgai cai, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />pa Tinggwang lunghop zau gade sakzie, pe rata piak gage zau haidi kemakpe ruigai kelude. Pecu kemci tinggimgwame nah Meurünna dwagade mi nah sulfur le tei keherei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa. 51:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Penuide tei keherei kecu mika de ka cuh bammui dizie, nah teikuu aide nah pe mie de reca kelame nah pezi kaugiak giakteu kelame da tingmui mede tingba dega kemtak gah. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Aide kemcimedung, Tinggwang sam kenzaimedung nah Jisu de kenlummedung de lia lulo kecu da.”<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Cidau tinggim gade makwa ge, “Aide raulu: Cu gade, ketsaime, Rampaube dage tsaigai kelume samlam pungtu,” de eh kerang Ih siu. Ge Tinggwang Rabe rang eh, “Yeo, iciu eh penui bata gade penui mtak luzie, kedanemene penui bata tei kegai de penuida ladi delu.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kideube luhlüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Pecai Ih piegai, ge hemwa keha ge bam. Hemwa ga Mina Nabe kenzwa ge ntum bam. Pa pe peu ga kecak peurwa ge la nah pe ba ga tangkane pemui keyi ge la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:16">Dan. 10:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Pecai tinggimgwame kedage kerecaki gade mpetlwe hemwa ga kebambe de sahbak eh qugai: “N tangkane keulwe rum cu. Kedanemene rum kerating gwang bam dida, kideube luhlüt meu dida.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Pecai hemwa ga kebambe pe tangkane kideu reu gage keziep gai, ge kideube rumlu.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Pecai tinggimgwame kedage tinggim ga kebam kerecaki gade tet pet; pe da de tangkane pemui keyi ge bam. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Nah tinggimgwame kedage, mi reu kengkieng kebambe, keru recabam gade tet pet. Pa tangkane pemui keyi de kebambe dage sahbak eh ranggai, “N tangkane pemui keyide keulwe kideube kube gurie gade kubetsi buidung de hekwalu, kedanemene cu au penui kubetsidung meudi delu.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Cine tinggimgwabe pe tangkane kideu gage keziep gai eh kideu ga kubetsi getlu. Pa cide kelien pwa Tinggwang lunghop zauniakbam kedi de gage kaidi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Pecai namdi gwale zaukeniakbam gade kubetsi tuigai, nah zaukeniakbam gade hejai hekwen kangria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hekwen kangria: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre kena cok ge</char></note> huge, nah 1,600 stadia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mile 184</char></note> ge lwapet.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa. 63:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Tinggimgwame hena nah kengkap hena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Cipaucai Ih tinggim ga marehi kedi nah miswakegah ge ngau: tinggimgwame hena da kengkap hena bam—kengkap kamtubedung, kedanemene cidungde le Tinggwang lunghop teicang gwang zie delu.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Pecai zudageu jaaidi mi ncüt kecu kenzwa ge ngau. Teikuu nah pemie, nah pezi kaupei de reu ngam kelumedung, Tinggwang ne penuide leibungdung kepeu de pwalwe zudageu jaaidi ga sap kebam Ih ngau. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Penui Tinggwang kilabe Moses lei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moses lei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ketwa lei. Lei aide Moses Hebrewme de Egyptme baang gade ngngwa mpet keludau lei tei kera ledeu kebeu lei. Tet. 15. </char></note> nah Meurünna lei tei bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">“Ngkiengtube Rampaube Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">n batadung au di nah miswagah lie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Heleuhdung Gwangpei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">n lampuidung au mzui nah masang lie.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Cau ncu hingme laino, Rampaubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nah n zi tei ndu me laino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Kedanemene nang rünne mci lu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Heleuhdung pelane gwang eh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ndwa ga ncu reca zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">kedanemene n bata kesamsangdung de keuliagai delu.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ge aidungde cai Ih piegai, ge tinggim ga zierang ketei paiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zierang ketei paiki: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide ainzwa qula, kedanemene cide au minadung kakga Tinggwang kebam zierang kecune, cide, Tinggwang de nsung lalu kera ge. </char></note> kebam kerecaki de ngkeidi. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Tinggimgwame hang hena, kengkap hena pwa eh kerecaki gade mpet. Penui langcimpai mci nah rebaaha kecuge bahla nah penui hekarak au kecak kiakangdung le kang teula. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Pecai ringkela kaune mdai kakgade hangge tinggimgwame hang hena de kecak kwak hena, kelungta ring kela Tinggwang lunghop puiting eh pwabeu. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Pecai kerecaki de Tinggwang kendu nah pe kengkieng gade kepet mika le puidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mika le puidi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mika cide kerecaki ga bam kela rabe rehi ge.</char></note> Tinggimgwame hang hena, kengkap hena de teicanglu kemaktane migede kerecaki cide ga lütlu tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa. 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang lunghop kwak hena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Pecai Ih kerecaki gade makwa sahbak eh tinggimgwame hang hena dage kerang siu, “Mie delwe kideu gage Tinggwang lunghop kwak hena de rui gailo.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Cine tinggimgwabe keraibe mie eh pe kwak kideu reu gage ruigai. Ge ngau kehing nah teei süt kecu zamdung teikuu kaugiak kepungme nah cipau mie de reca kelamedung reu gwangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:11">Keu. 16:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pekenabe pe kwak jaaidi gage ruigai, ge cide ketsaime ge jai nzwadi nah jaaidi ga ringkela kau leune tsaidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:8">Keu. 8:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pekecumbe pe kwak kereukidung nah duirwakdung gage ruigai, ge cidungde hejai mmidi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Nah Ih dui reu di kebam tinggimgwabe ma kerang siu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:5">“Nang au masang, cude nah ndaa de kela, Kemcibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">kedanemene nang ne aidungde tiak delu. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung, </char><char style="fqa">nang au mzui, Rampaubo, cude, nah ndaa de nah gwang dai kelabe, kedanemene nang ne aidung de tiak delu, de eh peila. </char> </note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:17">Keu. 11:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Penui kemcimedung nah caihakecime jai teilwa kedine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">nang penuide hejai sak kerade peu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Penuide hejai sak kerade peu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kereukidung nah duirwakdung hejai tei mmi di eh, Keu. 16:4. </char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:6">cide penui ngau kebuibe da.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Pecai recabam kelikegai Ih siu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:7">“Yeo, Ngkiengtube Rampaube Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">n tutiakdung au kesang nah mzui lie.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pemdaibe pe kwak tingnaimiak gage ruigai, nah cide peu pelum kechi le minadung de pugai. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Cine minadung de pelum kechi le pudi, ge penui kengkap aidungde kengkieng teu kebambe Tinggwang zi rangmsiadi. Penui helungnreu luma, nah pecu kendu peu ma.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pemengeibe pe kwak teikuu hegwangbam gage ruigai, ge pe hegwangram muitingdi. Pe minadung keteei de ziemne penui mleu gi bamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:42">Mat. 13:42</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Cine penui keteei nah penui keteei zamdung ziemne tinggim ga kebam Tinggwang de rangmsiadi, dede penui batadung gade helungnreu luma.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Pecai tinggimgwabe peherokbe pe kwak Euphrates reuki kedi de gage ruigai, ge cipau dui de canghdi, naimiak kepetle de kegwang hegwangme lampui mteilu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:27">Isa. 44:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Pecai Ih neidi mui gade, nah teikuu mui gade, nah kenret caihakecibe mui gade, mci kemak rabe kecum hegau nzwa eh mpetkela ngau. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Penui au miswakegah batadung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Miswakegah batadung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mimakecang batadung tei eh miswakegah batadung lie nlum eh kideube de cwa kerane. </char></note> ketei herakesiabe rabedung da. Penui kideu pelane ga hegwangmedung da mie, iciu eh penuide Ngkiengtube Tinggwang tingba kedibe nai ziemne keregi kera teu hekwalu kerane. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />(“Ainie! Ih keregame ge nzwa gwang zie! Mrak delwe pe paini bahlwe kebambe samlam pungtu, iciude pa paaula eh rwa melu kerane nah penui pe hengam ngaudi melu kerane.”) <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Pecai herakesiabe rabedung penuide heni Hebrewme let gade Armageddon lie qukela gage teu hekwalu.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pehenabe pe kwak tingkai gage ruigai. Ge makwa ge kerecaki hegwangbam gade sahbak eh ranggai, “Cide tei dida!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Pecai cika ting hepik, tingceu kengyim nah nnuihteu sütdi, mina kideu ga lunghgwang kelu gade madaude cinzwa kemak ge, nnuih aide teu mdisüt.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat. 24:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Babylon namdi kedi de pang zicum teidi nah kideu pelane ga namdidung kaudi. Ge Tinggwang Babylon namdi de nsunglu, nah pa pecu pe lunghop zau piakde pwapeu. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Pecai duigwadeudung pelane pakdi, nah lamlwadung ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Nah tangheu heudi, talent ge rüt ge,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Talent ge rüt ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram riakngei langge</char></note> tinggim gade minadung reu cakmie. Minadung kengkap tangheu de ziemne Tinggwang de reset, kedanemene cide ngau kehing kengkap ge kecune.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Mipui nah teikuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Pecai tinggimgwame hang hena hekwak hena pwa kebamme hangge gwang eh a dage ranggai, “Gwanglu, Ih ncu dui kekiee reu ga kebam helipui kedi de tutiak keulia zie. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Kideu ga hegwangme pecu ngngwa kemmha ta tei, nah pe kemmha zau sak eh kideu ga kelunghme miedi.” <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Pecai tinggimgwabe acu Rabe gade hetaideu gage ngngwa gaidi, nah Ih mipui ge teikuu giereba ge Tinggwang de rangkemsia zile puiting kecu reu ga bam eh ngau. Teikuu pepeu hena nah pekii kerei bam. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mipui de gieremang nah giereba kecu pai bah bam nah kecak net, tangtsu pemi kewhung nah tsugadung teula. Pe ba ga kecak piak kemneu keteidung nah pe kemmha keheradung le puiting eh pwabam. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Pe sipie gage kengkim zi ge raupwa bam: “Kedi Babylon, helipuidung nah kideu ga kemneu ketei leune pui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:2">Keu. 19:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Mipui de kemcimedung jai nah Jisu zierang ziemne teitset kedidung jai sakmie pwa kebam Ih ngau. Ih pecu kengau dau, a macangh sütdi. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Cidau tinggimgwabe adage ranggai, “Daitie n macangh dino? Ih mipui nah pecu pungkela teikuu, pepeu hena nah pekii kerei kebambe de kie kengkim de ncu ranglia zie. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Teikuu nang kengau ndaa ringla, dede cu ringla meda, cide penli kegah hekwa kecok gade cuh lai eh bam dida. Nah cide kengkap gage tetgai dizie. Kideu ga kelunghme, kideu damkelu gade Kering Laisiukwak gage penui zi rau teula kemakme, penui teikuu ndaa piage ringla, dede cu au ringla kemak de, dede gwang dai lai eh kelabe de ngau de penui macangh dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:11">Keu. 17:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Aide maci teu eh ci kera ge: Mipui ntum kebam pepeu henadung de kideutu henadung <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kideutu henadung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Rome, kideutu-hena namdi de rangbam.</char></note>da. Penui hegwangme henadung deda. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Hegwangme mengei kau dida, hangge cu de di bam reu, kedabe cude gwang mereu. Dede pa kegwang dau, pa peting keduina ge rünne gwale bam lak. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Teikuu ndaa piage ringla, dede cu ringla kemakbe de, pa hegwang pehesetbe da, nah hang hena gade hangge, nah kengkap gage tetgai dizie. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Nang kengau pekii kerei de hegwangme kerei penui hegwang kengkieng ngaulu kemakmedung, dede penui teikuu de ngngwa bamdakkak ket hegwangme tei kera kengkieng ngau luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:24">Dan. 7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Aidungde kelungzwa, nah penui penui kengkieng nah kedi de teikuu de peudi. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Penui Meurünna de ngngwa hereu tei zie. Dede Meurünna ne penuide ngam luzie kedanemene pa au kengkieng keteume reu Rampaube, nah hegwangme reu Hegwangbe, nah pecu ngngwa kebamdung de au qukelu, kedetkelu nah kesamsangme.” <verse eid="REV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Pecai tinggimgwabe adage rangdi, “Nang duidung kengaude, cipau reuga helipui ntum kebam de au, minadung, nah hemaadung, nah heleuhdung, nah heletdung. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Nang pekii kerei kengau de, nah teikuu de, helipui de ngkau zie. Penui pe da kebambe leune keuteu di delwe pecu peu paaula bam dizie; nah penui pe teih tyei zie nah pecu mi gage ru dizie. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Kedanemene Tinggwang pe lungning tei kera, nah suige tei eh Tinggwang samdung teicanglu kemaktane penui hegwangram teikuu de peudi kera penui lung teibeu kedine. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Cu nang mipui kengau de au kideu ga hegwangmedung reu kengkieng teu kebam namdi kedi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Namdi kedi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rome</char></note> deda.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Babylon kekau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Aipaudung de cai Ih tinggim gade tinggimgwame kedage nghungla eh ngau. Peda kengkieng kedi bam, nah pe kendu ne kideu gi mbaahadi. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Pa ngkiengsüt eh sahbak eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:2">“Babylon kedide kau dida!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">kau dida, kau dida, de eh bam. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Pa herakesiabedung kebam ni ge tei dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:2">mcikemak rabe leune ziemne kemsiu ni ge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">nah mcikemak nah kengkau ruine leune ziemne kemsiu ni ge dida.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kedanemene heleuh pelane pe kemmha zau gade sak luda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">Kideu ga hegwangme pecu ngngwa mmha dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:3">Kideu ga heliketeime pe kemmha kengkieng gade mahei luda.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer. 51:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Pecai Ih tinggim gade makwa kedage rang eh siu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">“A minadung, pe dade mpetlu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pe dade mpetlu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iciu eh pe mau ga ngngwa heta tei melu kerane nah peda gwang lai eh kebam kengkap ga ncüt melu kerane.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:4">iciu de nnui pe kemaudung ga ncüt melu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">nah pe kengkapdung ngau melu kerane.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kedanemene pe maudung tinggim hu ge hekwa luda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">nah Tinggwang pe bata kesiadung de nsung luda.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Pa mi dage tei kegai de kesiakge pe dage tei gailu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">nah pa tei kegai kena kieege peu dai beulu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">pa hai kebeu piak de gage pecu kena kieege hai beulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Lei. 137:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Pa pekatei pecu ndu nah kehega eh kelungh kieege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">pecu keherei nah lungrei peulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Kedanemene pa pelung gade rangla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ih hegwangpui ge tei eh bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Ih au hemipui ge ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">nah Ih kehap madaude ngaulak.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ciziemne tingnai ge gage kengkap peda gwang zie:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ketsai, kehap, nah herakum.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">Pecu mi ne ru dizie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">kedanemene Rampaube Tinggwang au ngkieng, nah pa au pe tutiakbe lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:31">Jer. 50:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Kideu ga hegwangme pecu ngngwa kemmha nah kenlwangme, pecu keru mika de ngaulu de pecu helung sia eh hap zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:46">Jer. 50:46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Penui pe reide kehingne kemdei ga sap eh rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:10">“Aiya, aiya namdi kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Babylon, kengkieng namdi de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:10">Kedanemene bamdakkak ket gage n tutiak gwang dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:8-9">Jer. 51:8-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Pecai kideu ga heliketeime pe ziemne heei eh hap, kedanemene migede pegu malui sita kedine, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />kecak kezwaniadung, rangkanggeu, tangtsu pemi kehung, tsugadung, langcim pai, gieremang pai, silk, giereba pai, perim ketei tsing ketsamtsam leune, hepwa ngeu le teikelu mania leune, nah tsing keyi le teikelu mania leune, hetageu, hegeu, nah marble, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />tamteimah, mosala, marim kehengui, tsingtsam, nah tsingca, zau nah maca, tokkui nah wheat, ketum nah meurün, hekwendung nah bagidung, hebaangme, nah minadung. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Nang hengin kela tsi de n dade gah dida. N mahei nah n kendu n dade tet dida, nah nang cidungde madaude ngau daigai lakta. <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Ma aidungde heliketeime pe ziemne mahei kelume bau, kemdei ga sap zie, kedanemene pe reide hing kedine. Penui heei eh hap ntei dizie.<verse eid="REV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Penui sahbak eh rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:16">“Aiya, aiya namdi kedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">langcim pai, gieremang, nah giereba</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:16">teu bah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nah kecak, pemi kehung tsudung</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:16">nah tsugadung kailwe kebam de!<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Kedanemene bamdakkak ket gage mahei pelane teimsia dida.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:17">Liem keteu kedime pelane, tet kelame leune, liem ketaume, nah jaaidi gade penui pok hi tyei kelame, kemdei ga sap bam.<verse eid="REV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Penui pecu ru kebam mika de ngau eh mragai. Penui rangdi, “Namdi kedi aikenzwa namdi daiga bamno?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:37">Jer. 51:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Penui suisia eh penui peu gage rebui mrokgai, nah heei eh hap eh sahbak gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:19">“Aiya, aiya namdi kedi de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">jaaidi ga penui liemdung kebam leune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">pe mahei gade hei kelumedung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:19">Kedanemene bamdakkak ket gage pecu tei ngkapdi delu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30">Eze. 27:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />“O tinggim, pe ziemne n suiyilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">nah nnui kemcime, langkegaime, nah caihakecime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:20">kedanemene pa nnui dage tei kegai ziemne Tinggwang pecu mmaudi delu!”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Pecai tinggimgwame ge ngkiengsüt kecu ge tangtsu tsuniakkang kedi langge pwa cuhlwe jaaidi gage keliengai, eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:21">“Ainzwa eh Babylon nam kedi de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">kelien nghung gi dizie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">nah madaude ngau dailak.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Leibung kwa nah leiketeime kwa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 18:22">terwaine nah telui kekwame kwadung de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">n dade madaude siu dai lakta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">Heciemta keteime keheibe de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">n dade ngausi dai lakta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">Ma niak kecu kwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">n dade siu dai lakta.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Mitaubung baa de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">madau gede n dade baa silak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">Lakciupei nah lakciupui kwadung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">n dade siu silak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">n gu heliketeime au kideu ga ditumedung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">kedanemene heleuh pelane de n reka teu eh cwa dida.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Pe dade kemcime nah caihakecime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">nah kideu gade teitset kedime pelane jai ngaulu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:49">Jer. 51:49</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Hallelujah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Aipaudung de cai tinggim gade mina maadi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mina maadi kwa ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hegwangbam dwa ga reca kebamme kwa.</char></note>kwage kenzwa ge sahbak eh kerang Ih siu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:1">“Hallelujah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:1">Kelikelu, kendu, nah kengkieng au anui Tinggwang gulie.<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Pe tutiakdung au kesang nah nzeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:2">kedanemene pa helipui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">pe kemmha le kideu de teihera kedipui de mmau dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:2">Pa pe kilame de teitset kedine</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">Tinggwang pecu saja peu dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Hez. 32:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Pecai pia pekenabe penui sahgai:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:3">“Hallelujah!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:3">Pe pum ru kebam gade mika kelungta kah bam dida.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:48">Lei. 106:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Hangkiame ngkaiemdai nah ringkela kaudung mdai de hegwangbam ga kebambe Tinggwang de keumie recadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:4">“Amen. Hallelujah!” de eh.<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Pecai hegwangbam gade makwa ge pet eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:5">“Anui Tinggwang de twalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">pe kilame pelane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:5">nah pecu hing kelamedung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">keceume nah kedime de.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:1">Lei. 135:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Pecai Ih makwa ge mina maadi kwa kenzwa ge, dui kekiee kenswak kwa nah tingceu süt kecu kwa nzwa siu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:6">“Hallelujah!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:6">Kedanemene Rampaube anui Tinggwang Ngkiengtube hegwang tei dida.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Anui suiyi nah renga eh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">pecu hetwa peu go</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:7">kedanemene Meurünna laktak ngyi de gwang bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">nah pe lakciubepui de pecu mtei luda.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Pecu peu bah kerane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">langcim pai keyi mci nah kemhei kecu ge peu dida”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:8">(Langcim pai keyi de au kemcimedung kesamsang batadung da).<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Pecai tinggimgwabe a dage ranggai, “Aide raulu: Meurünna laktak ngyi gage qugai kelumedung au samlam pungtu lie.” Pa a dage ranggai si, “Aidungde Tinggwang samdung kesang da.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ge Ih pecu reca zie lie pe pibang ga keumie, dede pa a dage rangdi, “Cide tei so! Ih au nang nah n siname, Jisu ha zierang tei kelame de ngngwa kila zangme gelu. Tinggwang de rünne reca lu. Kedanemene caihakecisam rang kera helung teigai kebeu au Jesus ha zierang tei kerane lu.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hekwen keha reu cwakelabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Pecai Ih tinggim ngkei eh ngau, nah cika hekwen keha ge bam. Pereu ga cwakelabe de kesamsang nah kesangbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kesangbe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu</char></note> lie qu, nah pa kesamsang teu hetutiak nah regila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:13">Lei. 96:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Pe miak au miheu nzwa, nah pe peu ga hegwangpeurwadung kekiee ge bam. Pa hezi ge pe peu ga rau pungla, cide pa gwale migede ci ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:16">Keu. 19:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Pa pai hejai gage mpung keluge bahla, nah pecu qu kela zi cai Tinggwang Sambe. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Tinggim reugwamedung langcim pai keyi, keha nah mcigi ge bahlwe hekwendung keha gade pecai suila. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Pemui gade kingtie pemui keyi ge pet, iciu eh pa cide teu heleuhdung de bilu kerane, nah pa hegeutie ge teu penui reu dizie. Pa Ngkiengtube Tinggwang lunghop kesia zauniakbam gade zau dau mpet zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:27">Keu. 2:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Pe pai ga nah pe mnie gage hezi: “Hegwangme reu Hegwangbe nah kengkieng keteume reu Rampaube,” de eh rau pwala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">1 Tim. 6:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Pecai Ih tinggimgwame ge tingnaimiak ga sapbam eh ngau. Pa tingkam ga nruinedung lim kela pelane de qu sahbak eh ranggai, “Gwanglu, Tinggwang taktyei kedi de ziemne ngkwa lu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:19">Eze. 39:19</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 39:20">20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />ciude nnui hegwangme, muibedung, kengkiengme, hekwendung nah penui reu ga cwa kelame, nah mina pelane, suirangme nah hebaangme, nah kedi nah keceume teih tyei lubui.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Pecai Ih teikuu, nah kideu ga hegwangme nah penui reugwame de ngau. Penui hekwen reu cwa kelabe nah pe reugwame de regi kerane gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Pecai teikuu de tuilu, nah pecu ngngwa kenret caihakecibe, pe dwagade miswakegah bata tei kegaibe de si, cide le pa pekaugiak kelumedung de nah pe mie de reca kelamedung de cwadi. Aipau kenade de mring mijaai sulfur ru kebam gage kelien gaidi. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Reugwame kedame pelane de hekwen reuga cwa kelabe kingtie, pe mui gade kepet de teu bitsetdi, nah nruine pelane penui teih tyei setlu.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Mmi cang ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Pecai Ih tinggim gade tinggimgwame ge hungkela ngau. Pa penli kegah hekwa kecok cabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Penli kegah hekwa kecok cabi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peda kebam cide satan da kaidi lubui iciu eh cide pe baang tei dilu kerane. </char></note> nah hegeuria kedi ge pe ba gala. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Pa neidi, ndaa henei, cide herakesiabe mede satan de tuilu delwe pecu mmi cang ge ziemne kangzeudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:9">Keu. 12:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Pecai pa pecu penli kegah hekwa kecok gage kelien gaidi, nah cide ngkuidi delwe cide giaknam di, iciu eh mmi cang cangdi kemaktane pa heleuhdung de cwa si melu kerane. Cipaucai, kaknage ziemne pecu lungmpet dai gai maisia.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Pecai Ih hegwangbamdung ngau. Cidungde reuga—Jisu ha zierang ketei ziemne nah Tinggwang sam ziemne penui peu dang kedime nah teikuu de mede pe mie de reca kemakme nah kaugiak de penui sipie gage mede penui ba gage de giak kemakme rabedung bam—nah penuide hetutiak kera kengkieng peu. Penui ring cuhlu delwe Khrista de ngngwa mmi cang ge hegwang teidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:22">Dan. 7:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Tsai kedi kedame pelane mmi cang ge cangdi kemaktane ringcuh dai ma.) Aide au ketsaime ringcuh kecu raitube da. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ketsaime ringcuh kecu keraibe ga kencütme au samlam kepung nah kemcimedung delie! Aidungde reu ketsai pekenabe kengkieng gah, dede penui Tinggwang nah Khrista cingkume tei dizie, nah pecu ngngwa mmi cang ge hegwang teizie.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satan kapdi kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Dede mmi cang ge cang kedi cai, Satan de pe baangki gade lungmpet gaizie. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Pa kideu kung mdai ga kebam heleuhdung de cwa kera mpet zie—Gog nah Magog—penuide keregi kera teugwang ngkwa luzie. Penui riak au jaaidi ga heciang kieege zie. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Penui kideu kemza langkie ga tet nghanglwe kemcimedung kebam ramzeuki nah hungkela namdi de twagwalu. Dede tinggim gade mi cakmie eh penuide rudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:6">Eze. 39:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Pecai herakesiabe, penuide cwa kedibe de kelien pwa teikuu penai kenret caihakecibe kebam mijaai, sulfur ru kebam gage kelien gaidi. Penuide tingmui tingba kelungta tei keherei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:46">Mat. 25:46</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ketsaime de kemmau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Pecai Ih hegwangbam keha kedi ge nah cika kebambe de ngau; pe dwade ting nah kideu pakdi, dede penui ziemne heni gede ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Pecai Ih ketsaime kedi keceu de ngau, hegwangbam dwa ga sap bam eh, nah laisiukwakdung de let pwabam. Pecai laisiukwak keda gede let pwabam, cide Kering Laisiukwak. Ketsaime de penui bata rehi gade laisiukwakdung gage raupwa keladung gade penui tutiak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan. 7:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Jaaidi de peda kebam ketsaime de lungmpet beu. Ketsai nah Hades penai da kebam ketsaime de lungmpet beu, nah keheibe de penui tei kegai rehi gade penui tutiak. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Pecai Ketsai nah Hades de pwa mijaai gage kelien gaidi. Mijaai aide au ketsai pekenabe. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Keheibe de Kering Laisiukwak gage pezi raupwa bam eh ngaulu kemakbe de mijaai gage kelien gaidi.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kehecibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Pecai Ih tinggim keheci ge nah kideu keheci ge ngau. Tinggim keraide nah kideu keraide gahdi, nah jaaidi bam si tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:22">Isa. 66:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nah Ih namdi kemci, Jerusalem keheci de, tinggim ga Tinggwang dade lakciube pui pe nahpei ziemne mtei teu eh kela nzwa hungla eh ngau. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Cidau Ih hegwangbam gade makwa ge sahbak eh rang kecu siu, “Ainie! Tinggwang paiki mina de ngngwa lungh dida, nah pa penuide ngngwa lungh zie. Penui pe minadung tei dizie, nah Tinggwang penuide ngngwa bamzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung, </char><char style="fqa">penui Tinggwang tei eh, de kecu kaisi </char> dede laisiu yitubedung cide si lama. </note> <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Pa ne penui miak gade penui miakdui leune neu gi dizie nah cika ketsai, lungrei mede kehap mede keteei bam si lak. Cidungde bam si lakta kedanemene ma keraibedung gah dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa. 25:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Pecai hegwangbam ga kebambe rangdi, “Ainie! Ih ma pelane tei heci dida.” Nah pa a da rangdi, “Aide de raulu, kedanemene aipau samdung de au nlumlukebuibe nah kesang lu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:9">Isa. 42:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Pa a dage ranggai, “Ma aidungde tei luda! Ih au Alpha nah Omega, pebangdwabe nah penlibe. Ih hereu kelame de peu pemi tei mene keringdui rwak gade mta sak zie. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Ngkieng kelube de aidungde gum luzie, nah Ih pe Tinggwang zie, nah pa a na tei dizie. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Dede kengngime, nlum kemakme, kemneuta keteime, mide dapketsetme, kemmhame, rekame, mamie kerecame, kenretme pelane, penui ziemne henibe au mi nah sulfur heukebam jaai de zie. Cide ketsai pekenabe da.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Pecai tinggimgwame hang hena gade hangge, hekwak hena ga keherei hena kamtube le kepui tei eh pwa kebambe de ada gwang, nah pa acu mpau eh ranggai, “Aika gwang lu, Ih ncu Meurünna nau lakciupui de lia zie.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Pecai pa acu Rabe gade ngngwa tet eh lamlwatu kedi husüt kecu ge reu ga ngngwa gwang delwe kemci namdi Jerusalem de tinggim ga Tinggwang dade hung kela liagai. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Cide Tinggwang kendu ne baa bam, nah pe kebaa au tangtsu pemi kehungbe nzwa, jasper tsu nzwa mcigi di. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Namdi ga kirie di, nah husüt kecu ge, herieki kereiekena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herieki kereiekena: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Israel leuhme kereiekena nah langkegaime de rangbam.</char></note> nah heriekidung ga tinggimgwame kereiekena bam. Heriekidung gage Israel leuhme kereiekena zidung raupwa bam. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Naimiak kepetle kirieki kecum, tingpeule kirieki kecum, tingpile kirieki kecum, nah naimiak kenlütle kirieki kecum bam. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Namdibe kirie de tsubam kereiekena bam, nah cidungde reu gage Meurünna gu langkegaime kereiekena zidung raupwa bam. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />A dage marang kebambe da kecak le teikelu kemdet geutie ge bam, namdi de nah pe riekidung, nah pe kiriedung mdet kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:1">Zec. 2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Namdibe petie pedi nsamram; cide petie pedi nzwakap. Pa kemdet geutie dele namdibe mdetlu. Cide petie stadia cang kereiekena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilometer 2221 nsam ge</char></note> (cide petie, pedi, nah pehu au nsam kap). <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Pa kirie de mdet gai, mina kemdet rehi gade cubit 144<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit 144: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre riakherokemengei </char></note> siu ge, tinggimgwame cide teu mdetgai. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Kirieki de Jasper le tei nah namdi de zudageu nzwa mcigi kecu kecak le tei. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Namdibe kirie tsubamkangdung au tangtsu pemi kehung ketsamtsam le tei hezuyi. Tsubamkang raitube au jasper, pe kenabe sapphire, pe kecumbe agate, pe mdaibe emerald,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:11">Isa. 54:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 54:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />pe mengeibe onyx, pe herokbe carnelian, pe henabe chrysolite, pe hesetbe beryl, pe hekuibe topaz, kereibe chrysoprase, kereieketbe jacinth, kereiekenabe amethyst. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Herieki kereiekena de au tsugadung kereiekena; herieki ge tsuga kangge le tei. Namdi puidiki au kecak mcitube, zudageu nzwa ngau rela. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Cu Ih namdibe ga kerecaki gede ngau ma, kedanemene Ngkiengtube Rampaube Tinggwang nah Meurünna de pe kerecaki de kecune. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Namdibe de taumbaa kera tingnaimiak mede hekei teu maisia ma, kedanemene Tinggwang kendu dene cide gi mbaa bam nah pe mitaubung au Meurünna delu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Isa. 60:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Heleuhdung cipau namdi kebaa gade tetzie, nah kideu ga hegwangme penui kendu cika teugwang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung, </char><char style="fqa">Heleuh kelikelubedung cipau namdi kebaa gade tetzie</char> de eh peila. </note> <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Pe heriekidung tingna madaude ngkui dilak, nah cika tingmui ge de bamlak. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Penui cika ge penui leuhme kendu nah hetwa ngau keludung teu gwang zie, <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />dede mcikemakpe keheibe de mede keheibe de hengam ta tei kelame, mede mide cwa kelame cika madaude nlüt gailak, dede Meurünna kering laisiukwak gage hezi rauteu kelamedung rünne zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa. 52:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Kering reuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Pecai tinggimgwabe kering dui reuki de acu keulia, crystal nzwa mcigi. Cide Tinggwang nah Meurünna hegwangbam gade lwa mie <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />namdibe puidiki sum ga lwa hung. Hereukikung lule ailam kering tsingbang petsi ketsamtsam kereiekena bui eh hekei ramsang petsi bui beula. Tsingbang neidung de au heleuhdung de teimmi lu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:7">Eze. 47:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Nah cika reset kera magede bam silak. Tinggwang nah Meurünna hegwangbam namdi cika bam zie, nah pe kilamedung pe gwa tei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:11">Zec. 14:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Penui pe zu ngau zie,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Penui pe zu ngau zie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Penui pe dwaga bammui zie, nah pe kendu ngau lubui.</char></note> nah pe zi penui sipiedung ga la zie. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Cika tingmui bam si lakta, nah penui mitaubung mede tingnaimiak teu si lakta kedanemene Rampaube Tinggwang ne kebaabe dizie nah penui kelungta hegwang tei zie.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Pecai tinggimgwabe a dage rangdi, “Aipau samdung de au nlumlukebui sam nah kesang. Rampaube, caihakecime rabedung Tinggwang, pe kilame dage matei kelwa gwang kerabe keulia lo pe gwabe de langgai.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:1">Keu. 1:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gwangla da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Ainie! Ih kelwa gwang zie! Laisiukwak aika caihakecisam keladung de mzai kelume samlam pungtu.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ih, John, ma aidungde siu nah kengaube da. Ih cidungde siu nah ngau luge, acu ma aidungde keu keliabe tinggimgwabe de reca zielie Ih pi ga keumie. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Dede pa a dage rangdi, “Cide tei so! Ih au nang nah n siname caihakecimedung, nah laisiukwak aika kela samdung de mzai kelamedung de ngngwa kila zangme gelu. Tinggwang de recalu!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Pecai pa a dage rangdi, “Laisiukwak aika kela caihakeci samdung de ngkiem kang nzeu diso, kedanemene aidungde teigwang kera peting nnadi delu. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Peu kesia keteibe de, kesia tei bamdi. Keherabe de peu hera bamdi. Keyi keteime de peu keyi tei bamlu. Kemcime de peu mci bamlu.” <verse eid="REV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Ainie! Ih kelwa gwangla da, nah a ziehidung au a da la,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a ziehidung au a da la: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ih mileune de peu kera ada pung gwangla: kering mede ketsai; tinggim mede mijaai, hegwangpeurwa mede reset de.</char></note> hangge ge kecude pe bata rehi gade ziehi pwapeu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat. 16:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ih au Alpha nah Omega, nah raitube nah kamtube, pebangdwabe nah penlibe. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Penui paini heta mcidi eh kering tsingbang gade petsi tyei nah namdibe riekidung gade lütlu kebui nzeu kebamme samlam pungtu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">penui paini heta mci kedime samlam pungtu, </char><char style="fqa">de mene, </char> kesa kehegwa laisiudung, <char style="fqa">pe ajadung tei kelame samlam pungtu, de eh peila. </char> </note> <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Hegwale bie kebamme au heteudung,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Heteudung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kemmhame mede Jewme kemakme.</char></note> kerekame, kemmhame, mide dapketsetme, mamie kerecame nah nret eh pe suira tei kelame.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Ih, Jisu, ma aidungde teu ngqwamedung dage zierang tei kerane nnui dage a tinggimgwabe de langgai. Ih au David mah nah pe leuh, baaha kebam tingcang pui delie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Nah Rabe nah lakciupui rang, “Gwanglu!” Cine siu kelume leune de peu, “Gwanglu!” de eh ranglo. Nah hereu kelame de peu gwanglu. Keringdui luu neu kelame de peu pemi tei mene luulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ih caihakeci samdung kesiume leune dage zierang tei gaila: Keheibe de aidung gage kaisi cai, laisiukwak aide gage raupwa kela kehereidung de Tinggwang ne pecu kaibeu si zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:32">Hez. 12:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Nah keheibe de caihakeci sam laisiukwak aide gade keugi dicai, laisiukwak aide ga raupwa kela kering tsingbang nah kemci namdi gade Tinggwang ne pe qwa keugi dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung, </char><char style="fqa">Kering Laisiukwak, de eh peila.</char> </note><verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Ma aidungde zierang tei kegaibe rangla, “Yeo! Ih kelwa gwangla da.” Amen! Gwanglu, Rampau Jisu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Rampaube Jisu ngaugia de peu kemcime da la kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>